{"unit_id":"anweat__dsh-browser#feature-feature-1","repo":"anweat/dsh-browser","commit":"673c8bb906752aab0f65296aae02ddc0a3e705a0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@anweat/dsh-browser 的功能「页面观察」：读取当前页文本，也可结构化返回控件、链接和表格；观察结果提供可传给交互动作的定位信息。通过 observe.read 触发，可限制区域、项目数和结果字节数。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/actions/observe.ts:53-70"]}
{"unit_id":"anweat__dsh-browser#feature-feature-2","repo":"anweat/dsh-browser","commit":"673c8bb906752aab0f65296aae02ddc0a3e705a0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@anweat/dsh-browser 的功能「网页交互」：按选择器或语义定位器点击、填写、输入、选择、勾选、悬停和滚动。通过 act.* 动作触发，返回更新后的页面状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/actions/act.ts:9-29"]}
{"unit_id":"anweat__dsh-browser#feature-feature-3","repo":"anweat/dsh-browser","commit":"673c8bb906752aab0f65296aae02ddc0a3e705a0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@anweat/dsh-browser 的功能「文件下载」：在当前会话上下文中请求网页文件，并返回保存路径、大小和 SHA-256；可指定文件名，超出配置上限的下载会失败。通过 target.download 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/actions/target.ts:41-59"]}
